{"value": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/yangfuhai/jboot/pulls/117", "id": 1574083290, "node_id": "PR_kwDOBX9q7c5d0pra", "html_url": "https://github.com/yangfuhai/jboot/pull/117", "diff_url": "https://github.com/yangfuhai/jboot/pull/117.diff", "patch_url": "https://github.com/yangfuhai/jboot/pull/117.patch", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/yangfuhai/jboot/issues/117", "commits_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/yangfuhai/jboot/pulls/117/commits", "review_comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/yangfuhai/jboot/pulls/117/comments", "review_comment_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/yangfuhai/jboot/pulls/comments{/number}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/yangfuhai/jboot/issues/117/comments", "statuses_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/yangfuhai/jboot/statuses/d6f0dd49de1f04104cf16e6f6045c54b72836d55", "number": 117, "state": "closed", "locked": false, "title": "Fix flaky tests", "user": {"login": "dserfe", "id": 123439795, "node_id": "U_kgDOB1uKsw", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123439795?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/dserfe", "html_url": "https://github.com/dserfe", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dserfe/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dserfe/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dserfe/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dserfe/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dserfe/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dserfe/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dserfe/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dserfe/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dserfe/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "body": "This PR is to fix several flaky tests.\r\n\r\n### Problem\r\n\r\nFor tests in `io.jboot.test.cache.j2cache.J2CacheTester`, if they are run before any of the following tests, the following test will fail\r\n```\r\nio.jboot.test.cache.caffeine.CaffeineTester#testDue,\r\nio.jboot.test.cache.caffeine.CaffeineTester#testGet,\r\nio.jboot.test.cache.caffeine.CaffeineTester#testPut,\r\nio.jboot.test.cache.caffeine.CaffeineTester#testTtl,\r\nio.jboot.test.cache.ehcache.EhCacheTester#testGet,\r\nio.jboot.test.cache.ehcache.EhCacheTester#testPut\r\n```\r\nFor example, we observed the following test failures when running `io.jboot.test.cache.j2cache.J2CacheTester#testGet` and `io.jboot.test.cache.caffeine.CaffeineTester#testDue` in sequence.\r\n```\r\n[ERROR]   CaffeineTester.testDue:45 \u00bb JedisConnection Could not get a resource from the pool\r\n[ERROR]   J2CacheTester.testGet:21 \u00bb JedisConnection Could not get a resource from the pool\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Root cause and fix\r\nThe config set up of `j2cache` in `io.jboot.test.cache.j2cache.J2CacheTester` will lead to errors of `JedisConnection Could not get a resource from the pool`. The fix is to use `ehcache` instead, which will make all tests pass.", "labels": [], "milestone": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "created_at": "2023-10-26T04:55:24Z", "updated_at": "2023-10-28T09:23:56Z", "closed_at": "2023-10-28T09:23:56Z", "merged_at": "2023-10-28T09:23:56Z", "merge_commit_sha": "38d2b184a7c9b161c41bae46fea324b9013023c6", "assignee": null, "assignees": [], "requested_reviewers": [], "requested_teams": [], "head": {"label": "dserfe:fix-flaky", "ref": "fix-flaky", "repo": null, "sha": "d6f0dd49de1f04104cf16e6f6045c54b72836d55", "user": {"login": "dserfe", "id": 123439795, "node_id": "U_kgDOB1uKsw", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123439795?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/dserfe", "html_url": "https://github.com/dserfe", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dserfe/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dserfe/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "h